take a look at the man page for "setserial"

you need to issue the command: setserial <device> spd_vhi

ie.  setserial /dev/cua1 spd_vhi

this is also covered indepth in the axp-list archive

FYI: you will want to leave your COM port set to 38400 and use the
spd_vhi setting to obtain anything over a 38400 connect.


