Daniel Faller <Daniel.Faller@physik.uni-freiburg.de> writes:

> 
> Whenever I type anything I get the error message unimplemented OSF mmap
> flags 0402

This is a FAQ. 
Just take a look at /usr/src/linux/arch/alpha/kernel/osf_sys.c.
The line in question is 

        if (flags & (_MAP_HASSEMAPHORE | _MAP_INHERIT | _MAP_UNALIGNED))
                printk("%s: unimplemented OSF mmap flags %04lx\n", 
                        current->comm, flags);

Which is commented out as of linux-2.1.129.

